  "description": {
   "en": "Yuka moves to Tokyo because of her father's work. At school, she quickly becomes friends with Momoko, who sits next to her. In the hallway, she is approached by the gloomy Nagura Ryuhei, who tries to recruit her to join the music club, but Momoko's quick thinking helps her join the Occult Club. There, Yuka learns that Nagura and she share the same star sign, blood type, and even time of birth. After school, Yuka takes Momoko home. They take a bath together in their new home, but are attacked by a large number of earthbound spirits. They continue to be attacked by evil spirits, but Nagura appears... A collection of horror stories depicting the strange events surrounding a young girl."
  },
